    slug: "milan-ivory-compression-sofa",
    title: "Milan Compression Sofa",
    description:
      "The Milan sofa combines practical innovation with versatile seating through vacuum-sealed compression technology that condenses the entire four-seat configuration into three manageable boxes. Each component—structural sections, four cushions, and upholstery elements—detaches independently, enabling you to arrange and rearrange according to your spatial requirements. This modular design philosophy extends beyond initial setup; individual pieces can be maintained, cleaned, or replaced without affecting the whole, maximising durability and value. Ideal for those prioritising both adaptability and hassle-free delivery without compromising on seating capacity. Available in Dark Grey, Black, Blue & Ivory Due to the modular design, each piece is connected via loops and snap clips Size available: 104 x 104 x 38cm per modular section 30cm height per back cushion 4 pieces plus cushions included in each purchase Packaging dimensions: Box 1: 104 x 104 x 21cm (GW 36.5kg) CBM: 0.227 Box 2: 104 x 104 x 21cm (GW 36.5kg) CBM: 0.227 Box 3: 104 x 104 x 21cm (GW 22.5kg) CBM: 0.227 Total CBM: 0.681",
